From 5cfe21badb5ba736f92f08c53eb210af6084d532 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Harshkamdar67 <harshkamdar67@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 20:27:05 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 25/32] vulkan: flash attention for one token over a long Q4_0
 cache with integer-dot scores, and an ordered list in GGML_VK_DEVICE_NAME

---
